    (`src/policy.rs`, `src/backend.rs`, `src/helper.rs`, `src/roots.rs`,
    `src/linux/`, `src/macos/` and `src/windows/`), is derived from Codex's
    `codex-rs/sandboxing` (`src/manager.rs`, `src/landlock.rs`,
    `src/seatbelt.rs`), `codex-rs/linux-sandbox` (`src/linux_run_main.rs`,
